 "source": "slurmrestd 26.05 (26.05.6-0pre1, a993e089c2) built from SchedMD/slurm, run with slurmctld, no slurmdbd; rest_auth/local as root. Requests are sent in order on one cluster with nodes node[001-004]. Warnings about accounting storage being disabled (no slurmdbd) are removed.",
